  message: "Shipped as PR (merged to dev as e64e0fbb6). install-extras runs gitleaks + embeddings + rust-analyzer installers in one call, skipping already-available components, best-effort on failures. --check prints the status table; --skip excludes components. uninstall-extras mirrors the install path. Component table lives in _extras_components() so adding a fourth optional dep is a one-line change. Thin _install_embeddings_impl / _uninstall_embeddings_impl adapters normalize embeddings to the (quiet=...) -> bool signature the umbrella expects. 19 tests, 100% coverage. Closes the WI-dotud → WI-huham dependency chain."  # 9a49
